  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Cities 2 W2 - Craiova Urban Rehabilitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EUR 14 million loan extension in favour of the Municipality of Craiova will  be used to cover cost overruns under the GrCF2 W2 Craiova Urban Rehabilitation  project. This is a further extension on top of the existing EBRD loan of EUR  24.2 million. The overall Bank&apos;s financing will be used for a mix of urban and  energy efficiency investments in Craiova City, including: (i) acquisition of 40  buses and (ii) rehabilitation of a pool of public buildings. The loan extension  will enable the City to finance cost overruns for the rehabilitation of 12  educational buildings. The increased costs are due to the impact of the  Covid-19 pandemic, the energy crisis, and the war in Ukraine on the prices of  materials, equipment and labour, as well as the incorporation of higher legal  requirements for buildings, construction and fire safety.  Null Value</narrative>
  </description>
